# Belt-and-suspenders: keep research-grade code, data, and internal notes OUT of this public repo.
*.py
# ...except reproducibility tools and block implementations (deliverables).
!tools/*.py
!blocks/*.py
# ...and the benchmark harness + scorers (exp/, deliverable code).
!exp/*.py
!exp/scorers/*.py
# ...but NEVER harness results / fetched RAGTruth data / caches.
exp/results/
exp/data/
**/__pycache__/
faithfulness-gate/
research-connection.md
STATUS.md
_rag-variant/
*-internal.md
lit-note*.md
calibration*/
*.csv
*.jsonl
# LaTeX build artifacts
*.aux
*.out
*.blg
*.log
*.bbl
